<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  8.46%			 C/S =  9.33%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ---			   O/N =  5.09%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  ---			   T/N = 11.88%</p>
<p>		   Dec  30, 1996			Dec  27, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.44%	1 month forward =  6.37%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.94%	2 month forward =  7.09%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.34%	3 month forward =  7.44%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.28%	4 month forward =  7.61%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.32%	5 month forward =  7.58%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.18%	6 month forward =  7.42%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
